            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy later questioned whether the record explained the medical profession\u2019s definition of \u201cimmediate\u201d regarding the time needed to make a telephone call to a judge."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
