          "text": "Petitioner Kelly A. Ayotte argues that the Court of Appeals struck down the act on its face based on a potential application that would occur only in a tiny fraction of cases, thereby denying state officials the opportunity to enforce the statute within constitutional limits."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioner Position",
