              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 39,
                "start": 39
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to MS. DALVEN, respondent counsel Ms. Dalven states that the complaint seeks a declaration that the statute is unconstitutional and an injunction enjoining it in its entirety, and that if that cannot be obtained, they want no relief."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MS. DALVEN",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "dc05b8b416e9b39d837952ed2a2981706e8c99d589ea660f32ac09ea81369f5e",
