              "pages": {
                "end": 40,
                "start": 40
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Ms. Dalven argues that the case is not the better course for three reasons, including uncertainty about which exception the New Hampshire legislature would have chosen and concerns about rewriting the law."
        },
